To better understand the regime of applicability of our work, let us mention a combinatorial characterization of $||f||_{S^q}$ when $q = 2k$ is an even positive integer: using indices modulo $k$, one has
\begin{equation} \label{eq:Schatten-2k}
    ||f||_{S^{2k}}^{2k} = \mathbf{E}_{\substack{x_1, \ldots, x_k \\ y_1, \ldots, y_k}} \left[\prod_{i=1}^k f(x_i, y_i) \overline{f(x_{i+1}, y_i)} \right],
